---
title: How to organize PDF pages
description: Reorder, rotate, and delete PDF pages in your browser — free and private.
relatedTool: organize-pdf
---

Rearrange pages visually before you share or archive a document.

## Steps

1. Open **Organize PDF**.
2. Upload your PDF — page thumbnails appear in a grid.
3. Drag pages to reorder, rotate individual pages, or delete unwanted ones.
4. Download the reorganized PDF.

## Tips

> **Tip:** Merge multiple files first, then organize the combined document for the final page order.

